Package-local scope
-------------------

Each independently distributable directory contains LICENSE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES. Applicable complete terms and exact provenance records are
copied into its THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/ directory:

- rhombus-hol-kernel: HOL Light-derived generated kernel.
- rhombus-hol-quickcheck: original 0BSD property-checking runtime; the
  non-applicable QuickCheck design-reference notice is retained.
- rhombus-hol-prover: HOL Light-derived conversions, rules, product, and number
  construction; non-applicable design-reference notices are retained too.
- rhombus-hol-stdlib: original 0BSD material; no third-party source incorporated.
- rhombus-hol: original source plus notices for generated web assets.
- isabelle-hol-kernel: HOL Light-derived formal rules, Isabelle-derived code
  serializer, and Isabelle presentation output.
